OL,3,GNEWSARapists jailed for teenage girl
OL,4,Aattack
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree men who raped a teenage girl at a
OL,7,Fproperty in Slough have been jailed
OL,8,Ffollowing what police said was a
OL,9,F"deeply distressing and complex
OL,10,Finvestigation".
OL,12,FTeague Rose, 36, from Windsor, Delwyn
OL,13,FRose, 28, and Raymond Sithole, 27, both
OL,14,Ffrom Slough, were jailed on Monday
OL,15,Ffollowing a trial at Reading Crown
OL,16,FCourt.
OL,18,FTeague Rose, who was found guilty of
OL,19,Fone count of rape and another of
OL,20,Fattempted rape, was jailed for 12 years
OL,21,Fand 10 months.
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
