OL,6,FDelwyn Rose, who was found guilty of
OL,7,Fthree counts of rape, was jailed for 11
OL,8,Fyears. Sithole, found guilty of one
OL,9,Fcount of rape, was also jailed for 11
OL,10,Fyears.
